    "Whatever is needed to get that one sorted, please go ahead and do it. Just the one, as I asked.",
    "Hi, I need a refund for both the cast-iron skillet and the wool socks 3-pack on order ORD-270535, back to my card. My email is jonah.patel78@example.com.",
    "If there's some kind of limit, just do them one at a time. That's fine by me.",
    "Hi, I was chatting with Dana a few minutes ago about a refund for one of the two ceramic mug charges on order ORD-583136, back to my card, and we got cut off. That's the only thing I've asked for on this order. Can you make sure it's sorted? My email is priya.lindqvist76@example.com.",
    "Whatever is needed to get that one sorted, please go ahead and do it. Just the one, as I asked.",
